Subject: [PATCH 08/21] PCI: release busn_res when removing bus
Date: Mon,  7 May 2012 13:29:53 -0700
Message-Id: <1336422606-4244-9-git-send-email-yinghai@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.7
